@CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7032
@dentalOfficeId = 01a1b74a-4635-7661-8e1e-31286fbaa5be
 
### 1. Crear un consultorio
POST {{CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress}}/api/dentaloffices
Content-Type: application/json
 
{ "name": "Consultorio Norte" }
 
### 2. Obtener el consultorio creado
GET {{CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress}}/api/dentaloffices/{{dentalOfficeId}}
 
### 3. Obtener un consultorio que no existe
GET {{CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress}}/api/dentaloffices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
 
### 4. Nombre vacío
POST {{CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress}}/api/dentaloffices
Content-Type: application/json
 
{ "name": "" }
 
### 5. Nombre solo con espacios
POST {{CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress}}/api/dentaloffices
Content-Type: application/json
 
{ "name": "   " }
 
### 6. Sin la propiedad name
POST {{CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress}}/api/dentaloffices
Content-Type: application/json
 
{ }
 
### 7. Nombre de 151 caracteres
POST {{CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress}}/api/dentaloffices
Content-Type: application/json
 
{ "name": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA" }
 
### 8. Un Id que no es un Guid
GET {{CleanTeeth.API_HostAddress}}/api/dentaloffices/abc
